# Plugins to enable on every machine, one name per line (a folder in plugins/). Blank lines
# and "#" comments are ignored. Order is the order they run in.
#
# dot-init installs the ones that aren't installed yet; dot-update updates the ones that are.
# To change this on one machine only, create plugins.local next to this file (it is
# git-ignored): "name" adds a plugin there, "-name" turns off one listed here.
#
# Create a plugin with: dot-plugin new NAME
#
# Examples that ship with the template (uncomment to enable; read them first):
# flutter          Flutter SDK (with Dart) in ~/.local/share/flutter
# docker           Docker Engine (Linux) or Docker Desktop via Homebrew (macOS); needs sudo
# nvidia-drivers   NVIDIA proprietary driver on Ubuntu, Debian or Arch; needs sudo; reboot after
